WEBVTT

00:23.000 --> 00:25.400
Well done, Xylo.

00:26.670 --> 00:29.300
I will grant you my praise too.

00:36.350 --> 00:37.940
Xylo Forbartz,

00:37.940 --> 00:40.770
you successfully defeated
the Demon Lord Iblis.

00:40.770 --> 00:42.610
Let's talk about what happens next.

00:42.610 --> 00:45.570
I'm not in the mood to hear
about troublesome things.

00:45.570 --> 00:47.760
No, you have to listen.

00:47.760 --> 00:49.400
It's necessary.

01:04.959 --> 01:07.210
Put that crate over here!

01:07.840 --> 01:09.380
There's more cargo coming.

01:12.470 --> 01:14.260
They're freshly caught.

01:20.140 --> 01:21.770
Hurry and move it.

01:43.460 --> 01:44.830
That's how it is.

01:44.830 --> 01:46.670
You and Lady Teoritta

01:46.670 --> 01:51.260
will be temporarily assigned to us,
the Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights.

01:51.920 --> 01:53.300
"Assigned", you say…

01:53.300 --> 01:54.970
What are we, spare parts?

01:55.550 --> 01:58.560
As for Lady Teoritta's worrying position,

01:58.560 --> 02:01.720
the military and the Temple
had been constantly disputing.

02:01.720 --> 02:04.310
After achieving a huge victory
in the battle at the fortress,

02:04.310 --> 02:06.190
the situation began to change.

02:07.770 --> 02:12.070
Xylo, you must continue
to protect Lady Teoritta.

02:12.700 --> 02:14.660
If I'm going to protect her…

02:17.200 --> 02:19.770
I haven't even had a single day off.

02:19.770 --> 02:22.280
We should be transferred away
from the front lines for now.

02:22.280 --> 02:24.000
That was my intention all along.

02:24.000 --> 02:24.830
What?

02:24.830 --> 02:29.670
Your duty as members of the hero unit
is to protect Lady Teoritta here

02:29.670 --> 02:32.300
in this port city, Ioff.

02:33.550 --> 02:36.390
Are you saying this city
is more dangerous than the battlefield?

02:36.930 --> 02:38.680
You are absolutely right.

02:39.180 --> 02:42.350
Some of the heretics
expelled from the Temple

02:42.350 --> 02:44.850
do not acknowledge
the existence of the new goddess.

02:45.270 --> 02:47.230
They might collude
with the order of assassins

02:47.230 --> 02:49.020
and try to harm Lady Teoritta.

02:49.020 --> 02:51.110
That's enough.
I'll listen to you later.

02:51.480 --> 02:52.570
Xylo.

02:53.690 --> 02:56.400
You are to protect me.

02:56.400 --> 02:58.530
You and the other heroes

02:58.530 --> 03:01.080
are going on vacation, Xylo!

03:20.350 --> 03:21.220
Huh?

03:32.820 --> 03:36.110
I heard you took care
of some Demon Blight,

03:36.110 --> 03:37.280
Xylo.

03:37.280 --> 03:38.870
What the heck? It's you, Jayce.

03:39.660 --> 03:43.080
I heard you took down three Demon Lords.

03:43.540 --> 03:46.790
But I bet most of it was Dotta
and Norgalle's doing.

03:47.370 --> 03:49.040
As for Iblis,

03:49.540 --> 03:51.590
I'll count that as your kill.

03:52.340 --> 03:54.340
I took down two myself, you know.

03:55.510 --> 03:57.230
You're not bluffing, are you?

03:57.230 --> 03:59.760
Isn't Rhyno on the Western Front too?

03:59.760 --> 04:01.670
That guy disobeyed orders again.

04:01.670 --> 04:03.640
He'll be in the punishment
room for a while.

04:04.140 --> 04:06.850
A penal hero in the punishment room?

04:07.310 --> 04:08.440
In any case,

04:08.440 --> 04:11.480
our score is two to one, so I win.

04:11.480 --> 04:13.190
Guess you're not so great after all.

04:13.190 --> 04:15.110
W-Wait a minute!

04:15.110 --> 04:16.860
Xylo is my knight.

04:16.860 --> 04:19.240
I will not allow you to belittle him.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.700
Are you the goddess?

04:20.700 --> 04:22.780
I heard Dotta picked you up.

04:23.280 --> 04:26.290
I'm so glad you're being protected
by a brat like her.

04:27.330 --> 04:29.830
H-How dare you speak to me like that?

04:29.830 --> 04:32.790
I have never felt
such a lack of respect before!

04:32.790 --> 04:35.870
Well, it's no use getting angry at this guy.

04:35.870 --> 04:40.760
Dotta didn't find her.
He stole her from the Holy Knights.

04:41.720 --> 04:43.520
It's pretty much the same.

04:43.930 --> 04:46.050
I don't care about human rules.

04:46.520 --> 04:48.480
Come on, hand it over.

04:48.480 --> 04:50.440
Neely will get mad if I'm late.

04:50.440 --> 04:51.160
Tch.

04:52.860 --> 04:54.820
Give my regards to Neely.

04:59.990 --> 05:02.760
Xylo! Who is that?

05:02.760 --> 05:04.410
His name is Jayce.

05:04.410 --> 05:06.500
He's a dragoon in our unit.

05:06.500 --> 05:09.370
He's an idiot who grows illegal plants

05:09.370 --> 05:11.320
for dragons and then sells them.

05:11.320 --> 05:13.460
And that is how he became a hero?

05:13.460 --> 05:15.460
His second crime is mutiny.

05:15.460 --> 05:19.760
Apparently, he went against the military,
trying to liberate the dragons.

05:19.760 --> 05:22.720
Normally, he'd be arrested within a day.

05:22.720 --> 05:26.310
But he's a high noble,
and dragons are unusually fond of him.

05:26.760 --> 05:30.740
This led to a rebellion that would later
be known as "Jayce's revolt."

05:31.270 --> 05:35.770
Heroes really are an odd bunch…

05:41.860 --> 05:43.990
Excuse me…

05:48.450 --> 05:51.000
P-Please calm down, Xylo.

05:51.000 --> 05:52.040
Okay?

05:52.040 --> 05:52.790
Yikes!

05:53.750 --> 05:55.420
P-Please wait a minute!

05:55.420 --> 05:57.920
If the Mastibolt family
hadn't sent reinforcements,

05:57.920 --> 06:01.060
the damage would've been worse, right?

06:01.060 --> 06:03.760
Yes, so I'll forgive you
if you let me punch you twice.

06:03.760 --> 06:06.430
Xylo! Do not resort to violence!

06:06.430 --> 06:07.600
It's fine.

06:07.600 --> 06:09.850
He's still hiding something from me.

06:09.850 --> 06:11.810
N-No, that's not true.

06:11.810 --> 06:13.530
Oh, speaking of which,

06:13.530 --> 06:15.310
Frenci told me

06:15.310 --> 06:19.610
I had to make sure you meet her,
or she'll kill me tomorrow.

06:19.610 --> 06:20.230
Argh.

06:20.230 --> 06:21.650
Frenci?

06:21.650 --> 06:22.950
Who is she?

06:23.380 --> 06:25.890
She was once my fiancée.

06:27.240 --> 06:28.030
What?

06:32.660 --> 06:34.580
How embarrassing, Xylo.

06:36.540 --> 06:39.500
What are you doing?
Hurry up and sit down.

06:42.210 --> 06:45.150
There's no sign of improvement.

06:45.150 --> 06:47.510
You used to be like a fly,

06:47.510 --> 06:49.100
but now you're just a caterpillar.

06:49.100 --> 06:50.180
That's terrible.

06:51.310 --> 06:54.140
Could you not compare people
to weird things?

06:54.480 --> 06:58.510
Oh? Is that considered
an insult among commoners?

06:58.510 --> 07:03.650
I just don't want you to tarnish the image
of the Mastibolt family's son-in-law.

07:03.990 --> 07:06.030
That's where we differ.

07:06.340 --> 07:07.960
Then I'll change.

07:07.960 --> 07:10.510
I didn't mean to upset you.

07:13.790 --> 07:15.960
So this is the goddess?

07:15.960 --> 07:18.040
Don't glare at her.
She'll get scared.

07:18.040 --> 07:19.960
I-I am not scared!

07:19.960 --> 07:21.710
I am a goddess, you know.

07:22.420 --> 07:25.380
Yes, and I'm not glaring at her.

07:26.050 --> 07:28.010
You are Frenci, right?

07:28.010 --> 07:31.430
What is your relationship
with my knight, Xylo?

07:31.430 --> 07:34.230
I told you just now, she's my ex-fiancée.

07:34.560 --> 07:36.870
I'm not your "ex."

07:36.870 --> 07:39.690
The vows are still valid, Xylo.

07:40.060 --> 07:42.940
Don't be ridiculous. I'm a hero.

07:42.940 --> 07:44.740
I have no right to marry.

07:44.740 --> 07:48.160
- Uh-huh.
- Legally, I'm not even human.

07:48.160 --> 07:49.990
"Frenci," was it?

07:49.990 --> 07:52.540
This man is a hero and my knight.

07:52.540 --> 07:55.630
It is his life's work
to devote himself entirely

07:55.630 --> 07:57.870
to using me and singing my praises.

07:57.870 --> 08:01.220
Although I feel sorry for you,

08:01.220 --> 08:03.130
he cannot get married!

08:03.470 --> 08:07.040
Xylo, it looks like someone strange
has taken a liking to you again.

08:07.040 --> 08:11.220
That reminds me of my father's
long-eared armadillo. It liked you too.

08:11.580 --> 08:14.150
Yes, and it scratched you.

08:14.150 --> 08:15.640
That was a merchant from the West…

08:15.640 --> 08:17.640
W-Wait a minute!

08:17.640 --> 08:19.940
Bringing up the past is unfair!

08:19.940 --> 08:23.230
And you compared a goddess
to that weird animal.

08:23.230 --> 08:24.690
That is too disrespectful!

08:24.690 --> 08:25.900
Anyway,

08:25.900 --> 08:30.200
I'm thinking of a way to get you pardoned.

08:30.200 --> 08:31.700
Hold on, I—

08:31.700 --> 08:34.210
And I'll be staying here for a while.

08:34.700 --> 08:35.909
After all…

08:35.909 --> 08:39.620
I have to pursue the Demon Blight.

08:43.090 --> 08:44.210
What do you mean?

08:44.800 --> 08:46.920
It's just as I said.

08:46.920 --> 08:48.510
For about a month now,

08:48.510 --> 08:52.850
I've been fighting the Demon Blight
with the lords of the night-gaunts.

08:52.850 --> 08:54.260
However, a few days ago,

08:54.260 --> 08:57.270
the Demon Lord's army
disappeared around this town.

08:57.270 --> 08:58.270
Disappeared?

08:58.590 --> 09:01.560
Yes, Demon Blight Number Fifty-Nine,

09:01.560 --> 09:02.860
Spriggan.

09:02.860 --> 09:04.230
I'm afraid that thing…

09:04.940 --> 09:06.840
has taken human form.

09:07.940 --> 09:10.050
A Demon Lord disguised as a human…

09:10.050 --> 09:11.160
Spriggan.

09:11.510 --> 09:14.120
It's a rare ability
even among Demon Lords.

09:14.120 --> 09:16.120
Damn it, this is troublesome.

09:16.880 --> 09:20.190
It might've infiltrated this town.

09:20.190 --> 09:21.670
Be careful.

09:21.670 --> 09:24.880
After all, it wiped out a city
in our territory.

09:25.500 --> 09:28.340
Well then, that concludes our visit.

09:30.880 --> 09:33.800
Who's listening in over there?

09:33.800 --> 09:36.530
No, I didn't mean anything by it…

09:37.140 --> 09:38.350
It's a rule.

09:38.350 --> 09:41.020
The supervisor must be present
for any meeting with the hero…

09:41.020 --> 09:43.160
I see. I'll be going, then.

09:43.770 --> 09:46.670
You need to come up
with a better excuse next time.

09:55.160 --> 09:57.410
I am definitely going!

09:57.410 --> 09:59.790
I heard about it from Venetim and Dotta.

09:59.790 --> 10:03.340
I hear the town is packed with rare goods
from both the West and the North.

10:03.340 --> 10:05.500
And you can eat your fill
of just about any dish.

10:05.500 --> 10:08.860
The only one who could pull that off
is Dotta, with his sticky fingers.

10:09.380 --> 10:11.470
Besides, we're not fooling around.

10:11.920 --> 10:13.760
The Temple heretics…

10:13.760 --> 10:16.190
We're going to lure out
whoever's after your life

10:16.190 --> 10:17.430
and wipe them out in one go.

10:17.430 --> 10:19.640
Yes, I know.

10:19.640 --> 10:21.230
Of course, I know.

10:21.230 --> 10:21.890
Sigh…

10:21.890 --> 10:23.590
Let me make this clear first.

10:23.590 --> 10:25.860
Don't tell anyone about the Holy Sword.

10:28.280 --> 10:31.940
If Galtuile finds out,
things will get more complicated…

10:31.940 --> 10:33.450
It will be okay.

10:33.450 --> 10:35.160
I am a goddess, you know.

10:35.160 --> 10:36.410
There is no need to worry!

10:36.410 --> 10:37.660
Sigh…

10:37.660 --> 10:40.290
I'll go into town with you.

10:40.290 --> 10:43.500
When push comes to shove,
I can be the goddess's shield and sword.

10:44.160 --> 10:45.120
Huh?

10:45.440 --> 10:46.580
All that's left…

10:47.330 --> 10:49.550
is to decide who to take.

10:49.550 --> 10:52.130
Venetim can't handle guard duty.

10:52.630 --> 10:56.390
We can't let Dotta roam the streets
without handcuffs either.

10:57.470 --> 11:01.060
His Majesty will start complaining
that he wants his own bodyguards too.

11:01.060 --> 11:02.600
As for Tatsuya…

11:03.980 --> 11:05.980
It's better not to let him
go out in public.

11:06.520 --> 11:08.860
My options are pretty limited, huh?

11:19.030 --> 11:23.160
Those idiots made Neely live
in a place like this.

11:23.160 --> 11:26.540
At least make it big enough
for her to spread her wings and tail.

11:26.960 --> 11:29.000
Hey, Jayce…

11:29.000 --> 11:31.840
I have work to do as a commander.

11:31.840 --> 11:33.510
Can I go back?

11:34.130 --> 11:36.970
Who's the strongest member of this unit?

11:37.290 --> 11:39.680
You and Neely.

11:43.520 --> 11:47.090
Then keep her in tip-top condition

11:47.090 --> 11:49.030
and shut up, conman.

11:49.810 --> 11:52.080
Just wait a little longer, Neely.

11:52.080 --> 11:54.570
I'll build you a nice bed soon.

11:56.400 --> 11:57.300
Hmm?

11:58.030 --> 12:02.060
I was just measuring
the other dragons' height.

12:02.060 --> 12:04.210
I didn't look under their wings.

12:04.830 --> 12:06.330
I didn't look.

12:06.330 --> 12:07.620
I swear.

12:09.380 --> 12:11.750
- This is going to take a long time.
- Have I ever lied to you?

12:11.750 --> 12:13.170
Wait…

12:13.640 --> 12:15.340
That's because she came to see me.

12:15.340 --> 12:17.840
- Is he really the only one left?
- I had no choice but to measure her.

12:31.770 --> 12:35.650
No, those guys were really out of line.

12:35.650 --> 12:38.320
The name of the order is Gwen Mohsa.

12:38.320 --> 12:41.040
Even I, who grew up there, thought,

12:41.040 --> 12:43.910
"Ah… this really
is an evil secret society."

12:43.910 --> 12:47.650
There's also a ritual where children
are sacrificed to the goddess.

12:47.650 --> 12:49.530
It's called the "Holy Communion."

12:49.530 --> 12:51.250
- That's really…
- Alright, that's enough.

12:51.250 --> 12:52.210
Yes.

12:52.210 --> 12:53.760
If we're so noisy,

12:53.760 --> 12:56.390
there's no point in disguising ourselves.

12:57.310 --> 12:58.550
By the way…

13:01.430 --> 13:02.720
It looks good on you.

13:02.720 --> 13:03.510
Huh?

13:04.010 --> 13:06.200
Didn't expect you
to disguise yourself as a man.

13:06.640 --> 13:08.230
You're perfect as a bodyguard.

13:12.310 --> 13:14.150
Look, Xylo.

13:14.150 --> 13:16.530
Do you want to buy a present?

13:16.530 --> 13:18.240
To commemorate today?

13:18.240 --> 13:19.610
Commemorate what?

13:19.610 --> 13:23.000
To commemorate the first time
the great goddess and her knight

13:23.000 --> 13:25.080
walked the streets together.

13:25.530 --> 13:26.980
I see…

13:26.980 --> 13:29.040
So, what do you want?

13:29.370 --> 13:31.540
You are going to choose with me.

13:31.540 --> 13:33.960
Didn't I say this was
to commemorate the two of us?

13:39.670 --> 13:41.760
What do you think of this cloth?

13:41.760 --> 13:44.140
Doesn't it sparkle?

13:44.140 --> 13:47.760
It's all brought here
from the West across Korio Bay.

13:47.760 --> 13:49.350
Many rare and precious items are here.

13:49.350 --> 13:51.530
Look, there is even that bracelet.

13:51.530 --> 13:54.060
Don't you think it suits me?

13:54.060 --> 13:57.730
Jadeite? It's so expensive
that you can buy a house with it.

13:57.730 --> 13:59.530
I wouldn't want to bring Dotta here.

13:59.530 --> 14:01.780
I am not asking you about its price.

14:01.780 --> 14:03.900
And Dotta is not a problem
right now either.

14:04.910 --> 14:05.990
Tsav.

14:05.990 --> 14:08.200
In this situation, what would you do?

14:08.200 --> 14:09.370
Hmm…

14:09.370 --> 14:11.370
In a crowd?

14:11.370 --> 14:13.670
The best way is to pretend
to be a random killer.

14:14.480 --> 14:17.420
Xylo, are you listening to me?

14:17.420 --> 14:19.920
I want you to choose.

14:19.920 --> 14:21.130
Alright, alright…

14:25.050 --> 14:25.970
Oh.

14:28.220 --> 14:30.560
If it's this one,
I can tell if it's good or not.

14:30.560 --> 14:31.850
A knife…?

14:31.850 --> 14:32.770
No good?

14:32.770 --> 14:35.150
Well, it's pretty dangerous
for a child to hold a knife.

14:35.150 --> 14:37.360
I can learn how to use it from you!

14:37.360 --> 14:38.820
Just choose one.

14:40.190 --> 14:41.870
In that case…

14:44.450 --> 14:45.860
How about this one?

14:47.280 --> 14:48.450
Wow!

14:50.080 --> 14:51.620
It's nice.

14:51.620 --> 14:52.980
So pretty.

14:55.000 --> 14:56.210
I'll take this one.

14:57.420 --> 14:58.840
And this one too.

14:59.550 --> 15:00.760
I'll pay in military scrip.

15:06.720 --> 15:07.930
Teoritta.

15:07.930 --> 15:09.410
Use it if you're in a pinch.

15:09.860 --> 15:10.430
What?

15:34.200 --> 15:36.670
No!

15:41.040 --> 15:44.010
Oh, this looks good.

15:46.110 --> 15:46.970
Hmm…

15:47.470 --> 15:49.930
Xylo, take the second route!

15:49.930 --> 15:50.930
Right.

15:50.930 --> 15:52.350
Let's go, Teoritta.

15:52.350 --> 15:54.870
I-It's already started?

15:55.390 --> 15:58.010
Sorry, we'll take
a different route for our walk.

16:15.230 --> 16:16.620
What's going on?

16:16.620 --> 16:18.330
Why aren't the Holy Knights here?

16:18.330 --> 16:19.870
This is bad.

16:19.870 --> 16:21.920
We can only assume
that something happened.

16:21.920 --> 16:25.460
They're not assassins from the order.

16:25.460 --> 16:28.510
They don't seem like they've been trained.

16:28.510 --> 16:29.430
In that case,

16:29.430 --> 16:32.550
it could be the faction
that's in league with the Demon Blight.

16:33.560 --> 16:35.180
The coexisters?

16:36.310 --> 16:39.730
At the very least, they're a group
that benefits from killing the goddess.

16:39.730 --> 16:42.560
Though I've always believed
they haven't infiltrated the military…

16:46.570 --> 16:48.450
Whoa, that's gross!

16:57.160 --> 16:59.210
What's with this guy…

17:02.500 --> 17:05.960
Seems like there's a trick to it, bro…

17:07.510 --> 17:09.510
It hurts like hell!

17:09.990 --> 17:11.970
Xylo, I…

17:12.390 --> 17:13.720
Stay back.

17:13.720 --> 17:14.930
I'll finish him now.

17:40.160 --> 17:41.000
Stop!

17:52.970 --> 17:54.300
A seal compound?

17:56.350 --> 17:57.220
Take that!

18:03.940 --> 18:04.780
Can you still fight?

18:04.780 --> 18:06.610
Who do you think you're talking to?

18:06.610 --> 18:08.030
Cut the crap!

18:11.360 --> 18:12.400
Tch.

18:12.400 --> 18:15.370
That's enough, Shiji Bau.

18:15.370 --> 18:18.700
Your opponent is the goddess
and the penal hero.

18:18.700 --> 18:21.370
Your chances of winning
are one in a thousand.

18:21.690 --> 18:23.630
It's time to retreat.

18:25.150 --> 18:27.590
Did you hear me, Shiji Bau?

18:27.590 --> 18:30.300
Jeez, you're such an amateur.

18:30.300 --> 18:32.510
Don't call others
by their names so casually.

18:32.510 --> 18:33.800
Boojum.

18:33.800 --> 18:36.450
I see. So that's how it is.

18:36.450 --> 18:39.100
I don't know much about the business,

18:39.510 --> 18:41.850
so please continue
to teach me as my senior…

18:41.850 --> 18:44.560
Sir, if we don't hurry,
the Holy Knights will…

18:44.560 --> 18:46.000
Silence.

18:46.000 --> 18:48.390
I'm talking to Shiji Bau.

18:48.390 --> 18:51.280
It's rude to interrupt others
when they're talking.

18:54.240 --> 18:57.570
Weren't you told not to kill
indiscriminately?

18:57.570 --> 18:58.940
Kill?

18:58.940 --> 19:01.080
I didn't do such a thing.

19:01.080 --> 19:02.580
That's way too cruel.

19:03.160 --> 19:05.040
But you smashed his jaw.

19:05.040 --> 19:08.730
You really are a lunatic.

19:09.460 --> 19:10.440
Kivia!

19:11.760 --> 19:12.760
Niskeph!

19:18.550 --> 19:20.430
Don't fire your lightning staff.

19:20.430 --> 19:22.720
It'll sting a little
if it hits me in the back.

19:53.770 --> 19:55.830
Penal hero…

19:55.830 --> 19:58.180
Are you the legendary Xylo Forbartz?

19:58.760 --> 20:01.470
You're Boojum, right?

20:01.470 --> 20:03.430
Were you in a circus?

20:03.430 --> 20:04.600
No.

20:04.600 --> 20:07.230
You're the one who's good
at throwing knives.

20:07.230 --> 20:09.150
I think you're more suited for the circus.

20:09.150 --> 20:12.260
Yes, to be honest,
I was in one for about three years.

20:12.260 --> 20:14.110
I'm quite good at trapezing too.

20:14.110 --> 20:16.770
Really? No wonder.

20:16.770 --> 20:21.950
Of all the people I know,
you're the best in the world.

20:21.950 --> 20:23.420
I respect you.

20:25.370 --> 20:27.500
Boojum, you talk too much.

20:27.500 --> 20:29.830
Don't give them unnecessary information.

20:29.830 --> 20:32.250
I see. So that's how it is.

20:32.250 --> 20:33.500
I've learned another thing.

20:33.500 --> 20:35.840
These guys are bad news.

20:35.840 --> 20:39.760
That woman is a famous adventurer, Shiji Bau.

20:40.390 --> 20:43.850
Unlike you, she seems to have
a high success rate in killing.

20:43.850 --> 20:45.060
Right?

20:45.060 --> 20:47.810
I'm kind and everyone loves me…

20:51.150 --> 20:53.650
Xylo, I will rain down swords upon them….

20:53.650 --> 20:54.900
Forget it.

20:54.900 --> 20:56.490
But if it were me…

20:56.490 --> 21:01.450
I know how painful it is
for a goddess to hurt a human.

21:02.120 --> 21:04.660
But there is something strange…

21:04.660 --> 21:06.860
There is a very strange feeling…

21:07.410 --> 21:09.370
Bro, they're here!

21:09.370 --> 21:11.710
Yes, they made it in time, didn't they?

21:12.290 --> 21:13.500
Huh…

21:13.500 --> 21:14.460
Hm?

21:28.480 --> 21:30.560
Help… help!

21:34.130 --> 21:35.190
Ah…

21:39.110 --> 21:40.070
Oh.

21:40.530 --> 21:43.190
You called us to such a cramped place.

21:43.190 --> 21:44.990
You should thank Neely.

21:45.350 --> 21:47.410
Yes. Sorry, Neely.

21:47.410 --> 21:49.450
We're saved, Neely!

21:51.000 --> 21:53.720
Ah, Neely is so kind.

21:53.720 --> 21:55.960
Of course, we'll go on vacation again.

21:55.960 --> 21:57.880
Let's fly to the beach tomorrow.

21:59.920 --> 22:01.620
I see.

22:01.620 --> 22:04.530
A dragon's flames are unbearable.

22:09.680 --> 22:11.820
Not enough blood.

22:11.820 --> 22:13.560
I've learned my lesson.

22:13.560 --> 22:17.040
Well then, I'll be… going now.

22:22.450 --> 22:24.250
What's the deal with him?

22:24.250 --> 22:26.700
He was burned by Neely's flames…

22:28.120 --> 22:29.120
Teoritta.

22:29.590 --> 22:31.430
What were you trying to say?

22:31.430 --> 22:33.670
About that hunchback man.

22:34.540 --> 22:36.930
To be precise, I do not know.

22:36.930 --> 22:38.360
It is just that for some reason,

22:38.360 --> 22:41.330
when I wanted to attack,
the resistance I felt towards that man

22:41.330 --> 22:43.360
seemed a little weaker…

22:45.510 --> 22:46.970
Perhaps…

22:46.970 --> 22:49.960
that man might be Spriggan.

23:10.790 --> 23:14.000
SENTENCED TO BE A HERO
